[
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.1.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.1.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ ἀνεκάλεσε Μωϋσῆν. Λευϊτικὸν ὠνόμασται, ἐπειδὴ τὸ τῆς ἱερωσύνης καὶ τὰ τῶν θυσιῶν καὶ ὅσα τοιαῦτα προσέταξεν ὁ Θεὸς, ἐν τούτῳ Λευϊτικῷ φέρεται.",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.1.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.1.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἔχει μὲν οὖν καὶ ἡ Ἔξοδος τοῦ Θεοῦ νομοθεσίας· ὅπως δὲ ἐτελέσθησαν οἱ ἱερεῖς χρισθέντες, καὶ ὅπως κατεσκευάσθη ἡ σκηνὴ καὶ σύμπηξιν ἔλαβεν ἀρμόνιον, καὶ ἄλλα πλείονα ἱστορεῖ τὸ Λευϊτικόν.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.1.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.1.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ δὲ καὶ ἕτερά τινα περιέχει, οὐ θαυμαστὸν, ἐπιγραφὴ γάρ ἐστι, Λευϊτικὸν, τοῦ ἐν αὐτῷ καιριωτέρου δηλωτικόν.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.2.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.2.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τοῦ αὐτῦ. Τὸν περὶ θυσιῶν λόγον οἱ μὴ ὀρθῶς ἐνορῶντες καταφρονοῦσιν ἢ ὡς εὐτελοῦς νομοθεσίας, καὶ μηδὲν ἄξιον τοῦ Δημιουργοῦ ἐχούσης.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.2.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.2.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἢ αὐτοῦ τοῦ Δημιουργοῦ ὡς εὐτελῆ νομοθετοῦντος ἀσεβῶς καταψηφίζονται.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.2.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.2.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὁ δὲ νοήσας τὸ τοῦ Δαυῒδ καὶ τοῦ Ἀποστόλου, τοῦ μὲν λέγοντος· « Ἀποκάλυψον τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς μου καὶ κατανοήσω τὰ θαυμάσια ἐκ τοῦ νόμου σου·",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.2.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.2.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "» τοῦ δὲ βοῶντος· « Ὁ νόμος πνευματικός ἐστι, » δύναται διαβλέψαι ὡς ἅξια Θεοῦ ἐστιν ἀποκεκρυμμένα ἐν τούτοις μαθήματα.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.3.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.3.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἄνθρωπος ἐξ ὐμῶν, ἐὰν προσαγάγῃ δῶρα τῷ Κυρίῳ.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.3.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.3.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τετηρήκαμεν δὲ πολλαχοῦ τῶν Γραφῶν τὰ μὲν δῶρα ἐπὶ τῶν ζώων λέγεσθαι, τὰς δὲ θυσίας ἐπὶ τῶν ἀψύχων κατὰ τὸ ἐν τῇ Γενέσει λεγόμενον·",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.3.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.3.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "« Καὶ ἐπεῖδεν ὁ Θεὸς ἐπὶ Ἄβελ, καὶ ἐπὶ τοῖς δώροις αὐτοῦ, ἐπὶ δὲ Κάϊν καὶ ἐπὶ ταῖς θυσίαις αὐτοῦ οὐ προσέσχεν.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.3.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.3.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "» Ἔτι δὲ καὶ τοῦτο ῥητέον, ἐπὶ μὲν τῶν ἐμψύχων· « Ἄνθρωπος, φησὶν, ἐξ ὑμῶν, ἐὰν προσαγάγῃ δῶρα· » ἐπὶ δὲ τῶν ἀψύχων, « ἐὰν ψυχή.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.3.s5",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.3.s5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "» Τὸ ἅψυχον ἡ ψυχή· ἴνα τοῦ μὲν ἀλόγου τὸ λογικὸν μόνον καταλείπηται, καὶ τοῦ ἀψύχου ὑπὸ τοῦ πυρὸς νενικημένου ἀπομείνοι τὸ ἔμψυχον μόνον.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Προχεοῦσι τὸ αἷμα ἐπὶ τὸ θυσιαστήριον. Θυσιαστήριον καρπώσεως ὁ βωμὸς λέγεται, ἐφʼ οὗ θυσίαι ὁλοκαυτώσεως· θυσιαστήριον δὲ θυμιάματος, τὸ ἔσω θυσιαστἡριον.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.5.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.5.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τοῦ αὐτὸῦ. Ἐπειδὴ ἔχαιρον ταῖς θυσίαις οἱ Ἰουδαῖοι ἐν Αἰγύπτῳ ταύταις προσεθίσαντες, ὡς καὶ ἡ ἐν τῇ ἐρήμῳ μοσχοποιία μαρτυρεῖ,",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.5.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.5.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐπέτρεψεν ὁ Θεὸς ταύτας αὐτῷ προσαγαγεῖν, ταύτῃ χαλινώσας τῆς πολυθείας τὰς ἀτάκτους ὁρμὰς καὶ τοῦ μὴ θύειν δαί. μοσι.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.6.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.6.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἐὰν δὲ ψυχὴ μία ἁμάρτῃ ἀκουσίως. Ἀκούσιόν ἐστιν ὅπερ ἄν τις ποιῇ κακόν. Σημειωτέον ὅτι τὸ ἀγνόημα τὸ ἀκούσιον, ἁμαρτίαν κολεἴ ἡ Γραφή.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.6.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.6.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ ἄλλων τινῶν μέμνηται ὁ μακάριος Παῦλος φάσκων· Σκιὰν γὰρ εἶχεν ὁ νόμος τῶν μελλόντων.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.7.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.7.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τοῦ αὐτοῦ. « ψυχὴ ἐὰν ἁμάρτῃ ἀκουσίως, φησὶ, καὶ μὴ ποιήσῃ ἀπὸ πασῶν τῶν ἐντολῶν Κυρίου, κατὰ φύσιν ἔχει.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.7.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.7.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἔστι γὰρ τάχα τινὰ καὶ προστάγματα Κορίου, ἃ οὐ δεῖ ποιεῖν κατὰ τό· « Ἔδωκα αὐτοῖς προστάγματα οὐ καλά.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.7.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.7.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "» Ψυχὴ οὗν ἁμαρτάνει ἀκουσίως, ὅτε προφάσει εὐσεβείας τὸ μὴ δέον τηρεῖ.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.7.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.7.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ δεῖται θυσίας πρὸς ἄφεσιν· οὐ δεομένου θυσίας τοῦ δρῶντος ἐξεπίτηδες· ὡς ὁ γεγονὼς Ἰουδαῖος ἵνα Ἰουδαίους κερδήσῃ, καὶ περιτεμὼν τὸν Τιμόθεον.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.8.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.8.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἡ ψυχὴ ἐκείνη ἥτις ἐὰν ἄψηται παντὸς πράγματος ἀκαθάρτου, ἢ θνησιμαίου.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.8.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.8.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Θνησιμαῖον δέ φησι τὸν ἀποθανόντα τῷ Θεῷ ἄνθρωπον, ᾧ χρὴ μηδὲ συνεσθίειν· ὁ γὰρ ἁπτόμενος αὐτοῦ ἀκάθαρτός ἐστι.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.8.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.8.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ τοῦτο ἀκάθαρτόν ἐστι τὸ θηρευθὲν ὑπὸ τοῦ ἀντιδίκου ἡμῶν διαβόλου.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.8.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.8.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Κτήνη ἀκάθαρτα εἴη ἂν, οἱ προσελθόντες μὲν τῷ λόγῳ κτηνώδεις, πρὸς θάνατον δὲ ἁμαρτήσαντες, καὶ μὴ γενόμενοι ἄξιοι σωθῆναι κἂν μετὰ κτηνῶν, κατὰ τὸ λέγον ῥητόν « Ἀνθρώπους καὶ κτήνη σώσεις, Κύριε. »",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.9.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.9.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Πᾶς ὃς ἐὰν ἄψηται αὐτῶν ἀγιασθήσετα. Τινὲ, τὸ « ἁγιασθήσεται, » μολυνθήσεται, σεφασὶν, οὐ διὰ τὴν θυσίαν, οἶμαι, ἀλλὰ διὰ τὸ τολμηρὸν αὐτοῦ ἁπτομένου.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.9.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.9.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀγγαῖος γάρ φησιν· « Ὅς ἂν ἅψηται, μιανθήσεται. »",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.10.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.10.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τοῦ αὐτοῦ. Λέγομεν ὡς διατροφῆς ἀφορμὴ μᾶλλον τοῖς ἱερεῦσιν ἧσαν αἱ θυσίαι καὶ σκιὰ τῆς εὐσεβείας.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
