  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.10.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.10.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Διπλοῦν δέ ἐστι τὸ κέρδος τὸ ἀπὸ τοῦ θύειν· καὶ ὅτι Θεῷ προσάγεται τιμὴ, καὶ ὅτι ἃ θύει τις οὐκ ἂν προσκυνήσειεν, οὔδὲ ἄν οἰηθείη Θεὸν εἶναι.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.11.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.11.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ οὐ μὴ ἀποθάνητε. Θάνατον ὁ λόγος ἔοικεν ἀπειλεῖν ἱερεῦσιν, οἶνον καὶ σίκερα πίνουσιν, ἡνίκα ἂν εἰς τὴν σκηνὴν εἰσπορεύωνται.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.11.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.11.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Δεῖ γὰρ τοὺς ὑπὲρ τοῦ λαοῦ εὐχομένους ἐπισκόπους ἀποστρέφεσθαι ἀπὸ μέθης, οὐ μόνον τῆς ἀπὸ οἴνου, ἀλλὰ καὶ τῆς τῶν πραγμάτων, καὶ διαλογισμῶν ἀνθρωπίνων.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.11.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.11.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὐχ ὡς ἄτοπον δὲ ἀπαγορεύει τοῦτο, ἀλλʼ ὅτι ᾔδει τὸ ἀκρατὲς τῶν Ἰσραηλιτῶν, ὅτι ὁπόταν ἅψοιντο, εἰς ἀμετρίαν ἐχώρουν.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.11.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.11.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἵν’ ὅτε εἰς τὰ ἅγια εἰσπορεύονται, νηφάλιον τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς ἀκριβὲς ἔχωσι, καὶ λεπτὸν τοῦ Θεοῦ μνημόσυνον.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.12.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.12.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Διὰ τί οὐκ ἐφάγετε τὸ περὶ τῆς ἀμαρτίας ἐν τόπῳ ἁγίῳ;",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.12.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.12.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Δείκνυσι δὲ ὅτι μὴ τῶν ἱερέων ἐσθιόντων, ἀτέλεστος ἡ θυσία, καὶ ἡ ἁμαρτία μένει· ἐχρῆν γὰρ καὶ ἐκ τοῦ αἴματος εἰσενεχθῆναι, καὶ αὐτοὺς φαγεῖν.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.13.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.13.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ σήμερον προσαγηόχασι τὰ περὶ τῆς ἀμαρτίας αὐτῶν. Ἐπεὶ συνέβη, φησὶ, τοῖς περὶ Ναδὰβ καὶ Ἀβιοὺδ προσκρούσασι τῷ Θεᾤ ἀποθανεῖν,",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.13.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.13.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὄτε καιρὸς ἦν φαγεῖν αὐτοὺς τὸ περὶ ἁμαρτίας τοῦ λαοῦ τοῦ ἀφεθῆναι ἃ ἥμαρτε, πῶς οἱ ἐν ἁμαρτίαις ἡμεῖς σήμερον ἐλεγχθέντες διὰ τοῦ φαγεῖν τὴν ἄφεσιν προξενήσομεν;",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.13.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.13.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Χρὴ γὰρ τὸν ἱερέα πρότερον περὶ αὑτοῦ ἐξῶ άσασθαι.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.14.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.14.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ταῦτα τὰ κτήνη ἃ φάγεσθε. Θηρία μὲν οὗν οὐδαμῶς ἐστι καθαρά· πάντα γὰρ ἀκάθαρτα κατὰ τὸν εἰπόντα νόμον·",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.14.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.14.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "« Πᾶν ὂ ἐὰν πορεύηται ἐπὶ χειρῶν αὐτοῦ ἐν πᾶσι τοῖς θηρίοις, ἀκάθαρτα ἔσται ὑμῖν.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.14.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.14.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "» Εἴη δʼ ἂν γενικῶς θηρία πάντες οἱ ὠμότατοι τῶν ἀνθρώπων, περὶ ὡν φησιν ὁ Προφήτης· « Ἐν τῷ ἐγγίζειν ἐπʼ ἐμὲ κακοῦντας τοῦ φαγεῖν τὰς σάρκας μου·» καὶ τὰ ἐξῆς.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.15.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.15.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ηᾶν κτῆνος δικηλοῦν ὁπλήν. Δικηλῆ τὸν εὐσεβῶς ἐν τῷ αἰῶνι τούτῳ πολιτευόμενον καὶ διὰ τὸν μέλλοντα αἰῶνα ἐπʼ ἐκεῖνον σπεύδοντα·",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.15.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.15.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πρὸς δὲ τὸ διχηλεῖν καὶ ὀνυχιστῆρας ὀνυχίζειν περιαιρούμενον τὰ περιττὰ καὶ νεκρὰ. ἀπὸ τῶν χειρῶν, τοῦτʼ ἔστι πράξεων· καὶ ποδῶν, τουτέστι τῆς πορείας.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.15.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.15.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Πρὸς τοὐτοις καὶ ἀνὰ μηρυκισμὸν οὐκ ἀποτιθέμενον μόνον τὴν πνευματικὴν τροφὴν, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἀναμιμνησκόμενον καὶ συνεχῶς αὐτὴν μελετῶντα.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.16.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.16.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὖτος ὁ νόμος περὶ τῶν κτηνῶν καὶ τῶν πετεινῶν καὶ πάσης ψυχῆς. Πολὺν ποιεῖται λόγον περὶ καθαρολ καὶ ἀκαθάρτου· πρῶτον ἁγίαν εἶναι τὴν ψυχὴν ἐκπαιδεύει.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.16.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.16.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ γὰρ τὸ φυσικὸν τοιοῦτον οἷον ἐκ προστάγματος Θεοῦ γέγονεν, ἀκάθαρτον, πόσῳ μᾶλλον τὸ ἀπὸ μοχθηρᾶς προαιρέσεως, καὶ οὐκ ἐκ προστάγμα τος Θεοῦ γεγονός;",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.16.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.16.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ τὸ οὗ Θεὸς ποιητὴς ἀκάθαρτον εἶναι νομίζοι τις, πόσῳ μᾶλλον τὸ ἐναντίως ἔχον πρὸς τὸ τοῦ Θεοῦ βούλημα, καὶ ποιοῦν ὅπερ ἀπηγόρευσεν;",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.17.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.17.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀνδρὡπτῳ ἐάν τανι γένηται ἐν δέρματι χρωτὸς αὐτοῦ οὐλή. Ἀνάγεται ταῦτα ἐπί τινας μώμους τῆς ψυχῆς.",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.17.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.17.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ ὥσπερ ἐπὶ τῶν τοῦ σώματος τραυμάτων μετὰ τὴν θεραπείαν ἔσθʼ ὅτε ἴχνος τοῦ πεπονθέναι τοὺς τόπους καταλείπεται ἐν τῇ καλουμένῃ οὐλῇ·",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.17.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.17.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον ἡ λαβοῦσα τραῦμα ἁμαρτίας ψυχὴ, κἂν τύχῃ θεραπείας, οἱονεὶ οὐλὴν ἐνίοτε ἔχει καταλειπομένην.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.17.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.17.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Δεῖ δὲ καὶ τὸν τρόπον τοῦ ἀπʼ αὐτῆς καθαρισμεῦ ἢ οὐ καθαρισμοῦ ἐξεπίστασθαι.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.18.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.18.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀνδρὶ ἢ γυναικὶ ᾧ ἐὰν γένηται αὐτῷ ἀρἡ λέπρας. Παρατηρητέον ἐφʼ ὧν μὲν λέγεται ἀνθρώπων· « Ἐάν τινι γένηται ἐν δέρματι χρωτὸς αὐτοῦ·",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.18.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.18.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "» ἥ « Ἀνδρὶ ἢ γυναικὶ, ᾧ ἐὰν γένηται ἐν αὐτοῖς ἁρὴ λέπρας· » ἐφʼ ὧν δέ « Σὰρξ, ἐὰν γένηται ἐν τῷ δέρματι αὐτοῦ ἕλκος·»",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.18.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.18.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἢ· « Σὰρξ ἐὰν γένηται ἐν τῷ δέρματι αὐτοῦ κατάκαυμα πυρός. Ταῦτα δὲ θραῦμά ἐστιν.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.19.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.19.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τὰ ἱμάτια αὐτοῦ ἔσται παραλελυμένα. Διὰ τούτων αἰνίττεται μὴ δεῖν συγκρύπτειν τὰ ἁμαρτήματα, καὶ σκεπάζειν αὐτὰ τὸν τὴν ψυχὴν λελεπρωμένον.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.19.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.19.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὤσπερ τοῦ παραλελυμένου τὰ ἱμάτια οὗ οὐκ ἐσκέπασται ἡ ἀσχημοσύνη· οὕτως βούλεται πᾶσιν ἐκκεῖσθαι μὴ γενόμενον τάφον κεκονιαμένον, Τὸ δέ γε περιβεβλῆσθαι τὸ στόμα,",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.19.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.19.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐστὶ τὸ μὴ ἔχειν πα ῥῥησίαν ἀνοῖξαι τὸ στόμα· τὸ δὲ τῆς παρεμβολῆς ἐξοίχεσθαι, τὸ μηκέτι τοῖς τῶν ἀγίων αὑτὸν συναυλίζεσθαι χοροῖς.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.20.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.20.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ σφάξουσι τὸ ὀρνίλιον τὸ ἓν εἰς ἀγγεῖον ὀστράκινον.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.20.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.20.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Θύεται τὸ ὀρνίθιον εἰς ἀγγεῖον ὀστράκινον, προεμβληθέντος εἰς αὐτὸ ὕδατος ζῶντος, ἵνα γένηται ὁ καθαρισμὸς ὕδατι καὶ αἵματι, ἅπερ ἐξῆλθεν ἀπὸ τῆς πλευρᾶς τοῦ Σωτῆρος.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.20.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.20.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ξύλον δὲ κέδρινόν φησι τὸ τῆς σωτηρίας ἡμῶν ξύλον. Τὸ δὲ κεκλωσμένον κόκκινον τύπος ἦν τοῦ τιμίου αἵματος, διʼ οὗ καθαίρεται ὁ κόσμος ὅλος.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.20.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.20.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οἶμα: δὲ τὸν ὕσσωπον, τὴν διὰ τοῦ πνεύματος θερμότητα· τὸ δὲ σπαρτίον τὸ κόκκινον τὴν πρὸς σάρκα σύμβασιν τοῦ Λόγου δηλοῦν.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.21.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.21.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τὴν κεφαλὴν αὐτοῦ καὶ τὸν πώγωνα ξυρηθήσεται. Ξυρᾶται τὴν κεφαλὴν, κατὰ τὰ κεφαλαιωδέστερα καὶ ἀρχικώτερα τῶν δογμάτων·",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.21.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.21.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "κατὰ δὲ τὸν πώγωνα, ὅπερ σύμβολόν ἐστι τοῦ ἀνδρὸς, ἀποτιθέμενος τὰ τοῦ ἀνδρὸς ἁμαρτήματα· κατὰ δὲ τὰς ὀφρῦς.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.21.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.21.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πᾶσαν οἴησιν, καὶ ἵνʼ οὕτως ὀνομάσω, ὀφρύωσιν ἀποτιθέμενος. Σύμβολον δέ φησι ταῦτα προσφύντα καὶ ἐξανθήσαντα τῇ ψυχῇ, νεκρότητος τρίχες ὀνομαζόμενα.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Λήψεται δύο ἀμνοὺς ἀμώμους ἐνιαυσιαίους. Εἰς τρία ὁ λόγος διαιρεῖ τὰ ἀναφερόμενα· ἒν μὲν τὴν λύσιν τῶν προημαρτημένων·",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἓν δὲ, τὸ ὅλον ἀναφέρεσθαι τῷ Θεῷ· ἕτερον δὲ, τὸ ἀναφερόμενον ἐπʼ αὐτὸν τὸν καθαριζόμενον τῶν ὑπʼ αὐτοῦ γινομένων.",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τάχα δὲ καὶ τὰ τρία τῆς σεμιδάλεως δέκατα παραλαμβάνεται, ἵνʼ ἓν μὲν τῶν δεκάτων τῷ σφαζομένῳ ἀμνῷ συναχθῇ, καὶ τὸ δεύτερον τῷ λοιπῷ, καὶ τὸ τρίτον τῷ προβάτῳ.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἤδη τοίνυν ἐπὶ τῷ πέμπτῳ καθαρισμῷ ἔχει οὐχὶ ἄλευρον, ἀλλὰ σεμίδαλιν, ὅπερ σύμβολόν ἐστιν ὕλης ἄρτου καθαροῦ, καὶ ταύτην ἐλαίῳ πεφυραμένην·",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s5",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὅπερ ὡς τρέφον φῶς, φωτὸς χρείαν καὶ οὐ πυρὸς ἐπιτελοῦν παραλαμβάνεται.",
    "chunk_index": 68,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s6",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἔχει δὲ καθʼ ἑαυτὸ χωρὶς τοῦ εἰς φύρασιν τῆς σεμιδάλεως παραλαμβανομένου ἐλαίου, ἔλαιον ὂ διὰ τοῦ ἱερέως ἀναφέρεται μέτρου κοτύλης τυγχάνον.",
    "chunk_index": 69,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.22.s7",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.22.s7",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ πάνυ δοκεῖ μοι ἱερέως δέεσθαι τό· « Στήσει ὁ ἱερεὺς ὁ καθαρίζων τὸν ἄνθρωπον τὸν καθαριζόμενον, καὶ ταῦτα ἔναντι Κυρίου. »",
    "chunk_index": 70,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.23.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.23.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ ἥξει τίνος αὐτοῦ ἡ οἰκία, καὶ ἀναγγελεῖ τῷ ἱερεῖ.",
    "chunk_index": 71,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.23.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.23.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ οὐδέποτέ φαμεν κατηγορήσοντα τῆς οἰκίας τῆς ἑαυτοῦ δεῖν ἰέναι τινὰ πρὸς τὸν ἱερέα, τὸν νομοθέτην εἰπεῖν·",
    "chunk_index": 72,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.23.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.23.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλʼ ὥσπερ δὴ μᾶλλον ἐξ ἰατροῦ τῷ συμβεβηκότι φάρμακον ἐξαιτήσοντα. Λελεπρῶσθαι δὴ οὖν φαμεν τὴν τῶν Ἰουδαίων συναγωγήν.",
    "chunk_index": 73,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg051.23.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg051/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg051.23.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τὸ δὲ τοῦ ἀναγγέλλοντός ἐστι πρόσωπον, ὁ τῶν ἀγίων προφητῶν χορός· οἵ καὶ ἐξαγγέλλονται τῷ μεγάλῳ ἀρχιερεῖ, τουτέστι πρὸ τῆς ἀγανακτήσεως, τῆς ἀπονοίας τῶν Ἰουδαίων τὰ πάθη,",
    "chunk_index": 74,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
